  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter and milk to potato and season with salt. Mash until smooth. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475cab85b0a022153045c33/step-be9fa7b6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook plant-based mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes (for best results, drain oil from pan before adding the carrot).\n• Stir in soffritto mix, cook tossing until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic paste, Italian herbs and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in the water, vegetable stock powder and the brown sugar and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add baby spinach leaves and cook until just wilted, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475cab85b0a022153045c33/step-d4880555.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• Transfer 'beef' filling to a baking dish. Spread mash over the top. Sprinkle over shaved Parmesan cheese.\n• Grill until the mash is golden, 5-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475cab85b0a022153045c33/step-0196a93d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Italian 'beef' and spinach pie with cheesy potato topping between plates to serve. Enjoy",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475cab85b0a022153045c33/step-901896fe.jpg"
    }
  ]
